WEBVTT

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:04.094
Last time
on Star Trek: Voyager...

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.570
My god.

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:10.975
We don't know exactly
how many vessels are out there,

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.478
but their space
appears to be vast.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:16.209
It includes thousands
of solar systems...

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:17.944
all Borg.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:20.316
We are, no doubt, entering
the heart of their territory.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.150
Captain, I'm detecting

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.554
two residual weapon signatures
in the debris.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:25.853
One is Borg.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.918
The other is of unknown origin.

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:31.624
I'd like to know what kind of
weapon could destroy the Borg.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:38.463
They refer to these new
aliens as "Species 8472."

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:40.473
Captain, it's not the Borg
that we should be worried about.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:41.735
It's them.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:45.370
The alien cells are consuming
his body from the inside out.

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:47.141
In developing a treatment
for Harry,

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.478
the Doctor has found a way
to attack the aliens

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:50.676
at a microscopic level.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.514
An alliance with the Borg?

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.385
More like... an exchange.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:58.619
We offer them a way
to defeat their new enemy

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.525
and, in return,
we get safe passage

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.119
through their space.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.395
State your demands.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:19.644
Can you get a lock
on the Captain?

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.078
Not yet.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:28.578
And now, the conclusion.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:32.918
Report.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.824
The Borg shields are off-line.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.351
I've got a lock
on Captain Janeway.

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:38.455
Get her out of there
and break us free of the cube.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.624
Stand by all weapons.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.424
I'm trying to energize.

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:45.232
The Borg are scattering
the beam.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.363
Compensate.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:49.972
No effect.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.408
We're being hailed.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.741
On screen.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.714
Commander,
cut the transporter beam.

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:57.215
Captain?

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.512
Do it.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.784
I have reached an agreement
with the collective.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:07.521
We're going to help them design
a weapon against Species 8472.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.960
In exchange, they've granted us

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:12.191
safe passage
through their space.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:13.563
Cube is altering course.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.431
They're heading toward
the Alpha Quadrant.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:16.901
That's part of the plan.

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:19.200
We'll work on the weapon
en route.

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:20.729
Once we're across
their territory,

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:22.968
we'll give them the nanoprobes.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.533
They appear to be holding up
their end of the bargain.

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:26.977
I suggest we do the same.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.072
How do you propose
we begin this "collaboration"?

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:32.607
I'm going to work here
on the cube.

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:34.984
They have technology
that'll make the job go faster.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.454
I want to take advantage of it.

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.354
It's not necessary
for you to stay there.

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:39.858
We can set up a com-link
with the Borg...

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:40.860
It's part of the deal.

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:42.589
I work here.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.054
All right.

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.733
As long as we're cooperating...

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:52.396
maybe the Borg would be willing
to disengage their tractor beam.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:54.372
We can match their course
without a leash.

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:55.738
I'll propose it.

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:57.640
Mr. Tuvok, transport
to my coordinates.

00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:59.474
Understood.

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.002
We're going to make this work,
Commander.

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.173
Janeway out.

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:11.048
You heard the Captain.

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:10.603
I've replicated nearly ten
million Borg nanoprobes,

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:12.941
each of them reprogrammed
to my specifications,

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:15.607
each capable
of targeting the alien tissue.

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.382
Assimilating it?

00:05:18.417 --> 00:05:20.282
Just momentarily.

00:05:20.319 --> 00:05:23.117
The Borg technology will
denaturate within seconds

00:05:23.155 --> 00:05:24.713
taking the alien tissue
along with it.

00:05:28.794 --> 00:05:32.662
Mr. Kim, I'm about
to inject your carotid artery.

00:05:32.698 --> 00:05:34.325
You'll feel
a tingling sensation.

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:35.561
Don't be alarmed.

00:05:58.024 --> 00:06:00.219
Nice to see you again, Ensign.

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:01.590
It's working.

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:02.889
Prepare another dose
of nanoprobes.

00:06:02.928 --> 00:06:04.020
Yes, Doctor.

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:05.724
Good work.

00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:07.392
Let me know when he's
back on his feet.

00:06:07.433 --> 00:06:09.731
Commander, I must tell you,

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:11.930
I have my doubts
about this alliance.

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:13.666
You may have convinced the Borg

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:15.640
the nanoprobes
can defeat their enemy,

00:06:15.675 --> 00:06:16.699
but a medical treatment

00:06:16.742 --> 00:06:18.300
is a long way
from a weapon of war.

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:19.709
We'll leave that to the Captain.

00:06:19.745 --> 00:06:22.407
This situation is unpredictable,

00:06:22.448 --> 00:06:24.040
so we're going to stay
at full Red Alert.

00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:25.948
Keep all information
about the nanoprobes

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:27.679
stored in your holo-matrix.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.119
Don't worry.
I'll delete myself

00:06:29.155 --> 00:06:30.520
at the first sign of trouble.

00:06:30.556 --> 00:06:33.389
Well... maybe not
the first sign.

00:06:42.601 --> 00:06:44.364
We've just received word.

00:06:44.403 --> 00:06:45.563
Tuvok beamed to the cube.

00:06:45.604 --> 00:06:46.730
He's joined the Captain.

00:06:46.772 --> 00:06:48.797
Keep a transporter lock
on both of them.

00:06:48.841 --> 00:06:49.808
I'll try, but the Borg

00:06:49.842 --> 00:06:51.366
are already regenerating
their shields.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:52.877
Try matching
their shield frequencies.

00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:53.879
It won't work.

00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:55.141
They'll be able
to adapt too quickly.

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:56.978
I don't want to hear what we
can't do, Lieutenant!

00:06:57.016 --> 00:06:58.244
Just find a way
to get our people

00:06:58.284 --> 00:06:59.342
out of there if we have to.

00:06:59.385 --> 00:07:00.716
Aye, sir.

00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:05.021
They've released
their tractor beam.

00:07:05.057 --> 00:07:08.117
Match their course and speed.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:10.890
I never thought I'd hear
myself say this, but...

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.955
Iooks like the Borg
are cooperating.

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:50.529
Kes, Kes!

00:07:50.569 --> 00:07:51.331
Kes!

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.099
What's wrong?

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:55.664
They're watching us.

00:08:00.746 --> 00:08:02.646
May I ask
where we're being taken?

00:08:02.681 --> 00:08:04.911
Grid nine-two
of subjunction 12...

00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:05.916
our very own workspace.

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:07.282
It's near the center
of the cube.

00:08:07.319 --> 00:08:09.617
These are my tricorder readings
of the bioship we examined.

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:12.647
I believe you will find
them most revealing.

00:08:12.691 --> 00:08:14.750
Have you compared this
to the Doctor's analysis

00:08:14.794 --> 00:08:17.024
of the alien tissue?

00:08:17.062 --> 00:08:19.895
Yes. Many of the cellular
structures are identical.

00:08:19.932 --> 00:08:21.900
The aliens and their ships
are made of the same

00:08:21.934 --> 00:08:23.265
organic material.

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:24.394
Apparently so.

00:08:27.439 --> 00:08:32.399
You have entered grid nine-two
of subjunction 12.

00:08:32.444 --> 00:08:33.775
Proceed.

00:08:35.581 --> 00:08:36.912
All right.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:41.048
We've analyzed one
of the alien vessels

00:08:41.086 --> 00:08:45.079
and it appears to be constructed
of organic material

00:08:45.124 --> 00:08:47.718
vulnerable
to the modified nanoprobes.

00:08:49.328 --> 00:08:51.091
I suggest we begin thinking

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.496
about a large-scale
delivery system...

00:08:53.532 --> 00:08:54.794
a way to infect their ships

00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:56.426
and destroy them
at the microsc...

00:08:57.436 --> 00:08:59.097
We will begin.

00:08:59.138 --> 00:09:00.969
What are you doing?

00:09:01.006 --> 00:09:04.100
A neuro-transceiver is required
for maximum communication.

00:09:04.143 --> 00:09:06.805
We will work as one mind.

00:09:06.846 --> 00:09:08.473
No, that wasn't the agreement.

00:09:08.514 --> 00:09:10.106
The neural link is temporary.

00:09:10.149 --> 00:09:12.413
You will not be damaged.

00:09:12.451 --> 00:09:13.611
I don't care.

00:09:13.652 --> 00:09:15.517
I prefer to communicate
verbally, thank you.

00:09:15.554 --> 00:09:18.523
Your primitive communication
is inefficient.

00:09:18.557 --> 00:09:19.922
On the contrary...

00:09:19.959 --> 00:09:23.326
we work better
with our individuality intact.

00:09:23.362 --> 00:09:25.887
Surely, we've proven that
to you by now.

00:09:25.931 --> 00:09:28.923
Irrelevant.
You must comply.

00:09:29.034 --> 00:09:30.331
We "must" do nothing.

00:09:30.369 --> 00:09:33.702
Tell your drone
to remove the transceiver.

00:09:39.178 --> 00:09:41.942
What about choosing
a representative...

00:09:42.047 --> 00:09:45.380
a single Borg we can work with
and talk to directly?

00:09:45.417 --> 00:09:46.543
Elaborate.

00:09:46.585 --> 00:09:48.177
You've done it before

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:51.121
when you transformed
Jean-Luc Picard into Locutus.

00:09:51.156 --> 00:09:53.556
We will not be assimilated.

00:09:53.592 --> 00:09:56.618
Choose a representative,
or the deal's off!

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.462
I speak for the Borg.

00:10:38.102 --> 00:10:39.501
I'm Captain Janeway.

00:10:39.537 --> 00:10:40.936
This is Lieutenant Tuvok.

00:10:40.972 --> 00:10:43.099
We are aware
of your designations.

00:10:43.141 --> 00:10:45.166
What's your designation?

00:10:45.209 --> 00:10:47.006
Seven of Nine,

00:10:47.078 --> 00:10:49.979
Tertiary Adjunct
of Unimatrix Zero One.

00:10:50.014 --> 00:10:52.881
But you may call me
Seven of Nine.

00:10:55.486 --> 00:10:58.353
You are proposing
a large-scale weapon.

00:10:58.389 --> 00:10:59.686
We concur.

00:10:59.724 --> 00:11:01.123
I thought you might.

00:11:01.159 --> 00:11:04.959
We could encase the nanoprobes
in some of our photon torpedoes

00:11:04.996 --> 00:11:07.931
in essence, turn them
into biomolecular warheads.

00:11:07.965 --> 00:11:10.593
Your torpedoes are inadequate.

00:11:10.635 --> 00:11:13.468
They lack the necessary range
and dispersive force.

00:11:13.504 --> 00:11:15.301
Do you have a better idea?

00:11:16.507 --> 00:11:17.599
We are Borg.

00:11:20.411 --> 00:11:22.311
I take that as a "yes."

00:11:32.123 --> 00:11:35.149
A multikinetic neutronic mine...

00:11:35.193 --> 00:11:37.491
five million isoton yield.

00:11:37.528 --> 00:11:38.495
An explosion that size

00:11:38.529 --> 00:11:40.292
could affect
an entire star system.

00:11:40.331 --> 00:11:41.923
Correct.

00:11:41.966 --> 00:11:44.833
The shock wave will disperse
the nanoprobes over a radius

00:11:44.869 --> 00:11:45.858
of five light-years.

00:11:45.903 --> 00:11:48.895
That's somewhat larger
than I had in mind.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.568
You're proposing a weapon
of mass destruction.

00:11:51.609 --> 00:11:53.236
We are.

00:11:53.277 --> 00:11:55.006
Well, I'm not.

00:11:55.079 --> 00:11:57.013
You'd be endangering
innocent worlds.

00:11:57.115 --> 00:11:58.912
It would be efficient.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:01.418
We would need approximately
50 trillion nanoprobes

00:12:01.452 --> 00:12:02.851
to arm this mine.

00:12:02.887 --> 00:12:03.945
It would take the Doctor

00:12:04.021 --> 00:12:05.784
several weeks
to replicate that amount.

00:12:05.823 --> 00:12:07.688
You are losing this conflict.

00:12:07.725 --> 00:12:09.955
Are you willing
to risk further delay?

00:12:10.027 --> 00:12:13.758
Right now, your enemy
believes it is invulnerable.

00:12:13.798 --> 00:12:17.757
If we create smaller weapons
using our torpedoes,

00:12:17.802 --> 00:12:20.600
and destroy
a few of their bioships

00:12:20.638 --> 00:12:21.969
it may deter them,

00:12:22.006 --> 00:12:24.099
convince them
to give up this war.

00:12:24.142 --> 00:12:27.134
You are individuals.

00:12:27.178 --> 00:12:31.012
You are small
and you think in small terms.

00:12:38.656 --> 00:12:41.284
But the present
situation requires

00:12:41.325 --> 00:12:43.020
that we consider your plan.

00:12:49.534 --> 00:12:51.934
Voyager's weapons inventory.

00:12:51.969 --> 00:12:56.167
Photon torpedo complement... 32,
class-6 warhead.

00:12:56.207 --> 00:12:58.675
Explosive yield... 200 isotons.

00:12:58.709 --> 00:13:00.677
How did you obtain
this information?

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:03.913
We are Borg.

00:13:06.017 --> 00:13:07.314
Naturally.

00:13:23.234 --> 00:13:25.634
Commander, we have
some disturbing news.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:27.103
At this point,
I'm getting used to it.

00:13:27.138 --> 00:13:29.470
Her telepathic visions
are increasing,

00:13:29.507 --> 00:13:31.600
both in frequency and intensity.

00:13:31.642 --> 00:13:33.234
It feels different this time.

00:13:33.277 --> 00:13:39.307
It's almost like...
they're right here in the room.

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:40.977
There it is again.

00:13:41.018 --> 00:13:43.486
I'm trying to block them out...

00:13:43.521 --> 00:13:45.512
but I can't.

00:13:48.292 --> 00:13:51.125
Every time she has a vision,
specific regions

00:13:51.162 --> 00:13:52.254
of her cerebral cortex

00:13:52.296 --> 00:13:54.161
go into a state
of hyper-stimulation...

00:13:54.198 --> 00:13:56.598
memory engrams,
perceptual centers.

00:13:56.634 --> 00:13:58.795
I can't be sure, but I think
there's more going on here

00:13:58.836 --> 00:13:59.962
than just a simple "hello."

00:14:04.141 --> 00:14:05.130
Enhance this grid.

00:14:05.176 --> 00:14:07.201
I want to take a closer look
at the detonator.

00:14:11.249 --> 00:14:13.547
We must analyze the bioship.

00:14:13.584 --> 00:14:14.778
Your data.

00:14:31.402 --> 00:14:33.267
You're human, aren't you?

00:14:33.304 --> 00:14:35.966
This body was assimilated
18 years ago.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.270
It ceased to be human
at that time.

00:14:38.309 --> 00:14:40.243
I'm curious.
What was your name before?

00:14:40.278 --> 00:14:43.008
Do not engage us
in further irrelevant discourse.

00:14:44.682 --> 00:14:47.480
We are being hailed
by your vessel.

00:14:52.356 --> 00:14:53.584
Commander, what is it?

00:14:53.624 --> 00:14:54.921
It's Kes.

00:14:54.959 --> 00:14:55.926
The Doctor believes

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.621
that the aliens
are accessing her memory.

00:14:57.662 --> 00:14:58.629
If that's true,

00:14:58.663 --> 00:15:01.097
they may already know
what we're planning.

00:15:01.132 --> 00:15:03.498
I've ordered long-range scans
for bioships.

00:15:03.534 --> 00:15:04.501
Nothing so far.

00:15:04.535 --> 00:15:07.629
We should alter course,
try to throw them off.

00:15:07.672 --> 00:15:08.661
Agreed.

00:15:11.409 --> 00:15:14.344
Our course and heading
have been changed.

00:15:14.378 --> 00:15:17.939
Match them and keep me apprised
of any changes in Kes.

00:15:18.049 --> 00:15:19.038
Chakotay out.

00:15:20.418 --> 00:15:22.943
We now require
one of your photon torpedoes

00:15:22.987 --> 00:15:24.113
and the nanoprobes.

00:15:24.155 --> 00:15:25.588
One step at a time.

00:15:25.623 --> 00:15:28.114
We're not safely across
your territory yet.

00:15:28.159 --> 00:15:32.118
We must construct
and test a prototype now.

00:15:32.163 --> 00:15:33.425
The risk of attack
has increased.

00:15:33.464 --> 00:15:34.431
Irrelevant.

00:15:34.465 --> 00:15:35.762
We have an agreement.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.961
You're asking me
to give up my only guarantee

00:15:38.002 --> 00:15:39.469
that you won't assimilate us.

00:15:39.503 --> 00:15:40.697
I won't risk it.

00:15:40.738 --> 00:15:44.401
Are you willing to risk
a direct confrontation with us?

00:15:45.943 --> 00:15:49.970
If we transport
500 drones onto your vessel,

00:15:50.014 --> 00:15:52.983
do you believe you could offer
sufficient resistance?

00:15:53.084 --> 00:15:55.143
We'd die trying.

00:15:57.421 --> 00:15:59.855
That won't be necessary.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.380
We must construct
a launching system

00:16:01.425 --> 00:16:03.052
to accommodate this design.

00:16:08.032 --> 00:16:09.897
Glad you could join us, Mr. Kim.

00:16:09.934 --> 00:16:12.459
Harry, welcome back.

00:16:12.503 --> 00:16:14.403
Thanks.
Reporting for duty, sir.

00:16:14.438 --> 00:16:16.235
The Doctor gave me
a clean bill of health.

00:16:16.273 --> 00:16:17.934
Did I miss anything?

00:16:18.042 --> 00:16:20.237
Not too much.

00:16:20.277 --> 00:16:21.369
Take your station, Ensign.

00:16:27.451 --> 00:16:30.147
You've still got a tendril
up your nose.

00:16:31.322 --> 00:16:34.485
Commander, I'm picking up
gravimetric distortions.

00:16:34.525 --> 00:16:35.958
12,000 kilometers aft.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:38.722
It's a singularity.

00:16:41.432 --> 00:16:43.764
We are under attack.

00:16:47.805 --> 00:16:48.931
They're charging weapons.

00:16:48.973 --> 00:16:50.201
Shields.

00:16:50.241 --> 00:16:51.367
Keep a lock on the away team.

00:16:53.044 --> 00:16:54.978
Direct hit
to our secondary hull.

00:16:56.147 --> 00:16:57.205
Transporters are off-line.

00:16:57.248 --> 00:16:58.738
Shields and weapons are down.

00:17:04.321 --> 00:17:06.312
Voyager has taken heavy damage.

00:17:06.357 --> 00:17:09.258
We cannot let the nanoprobes
be destroyed.

00:17:11.262 --> 00:17:12.627
We're being targeted.

00:17:12.663 --> 00:17:13.721
Brace for impact.

00:17:35.652 --> 00:17:37.552
The cube?

00:17:37.587 --> 00:17:40.283
Destroyed... and it took
the bioship with it.

00:17:40.323 --> 00:17:42.917
Tuvok to Chakotay.

00:17:42.959 --> 00:17:44.586
Go ahead, Tuvok.
Where are you?

00:17:44.627 --> 00:17:46.322
I'm in Cargo Bay 2...

00:17:48.064 --> 00:17:50.794
along with the Captain...

00:17:50.834 --> 00:17:53.200
and a number of Borg.

00:17:53.236 --> 00:17:56.797
We were beamed over
just before impact.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.967
We require assistance.

00:18:00.043 --> 00:18:03.012
Tuvok? Tuvok?

00:18:03.046 --> 00:18:04.911
Secure that deck.

00:18:04.981 --> 00:18:06.778
Security team to Cargo Bay 2.

00:18:06.816 --> 00:18:08.841
Paris, you have the Bridge.

00:18:39.048 --> 00:18:41.107
Lower your weapons.

00:18:44.821 --> 00:18:47.517
We are here
with your Captain's consent.

00:18:47.557 --> 00:18:51.789
It was necessary to sacrifice
our vessel to protect yours.

00:18:58.034 --> 00:19:01.003
We have an alliance, do we not?

00:19:06.409 --> 00:19:07.740
For now, they're contained.

00:19:07.777 --> 00:19:09.210
They've assimilated Cargo Bay 2

00:19:09.245 --> 00:19:11.907
and are drawing energy from
the secondary power couplings.

00:19:11.981 --> 00:19:13.710
But they've gone no further?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.911
Not yet.
I've sealed off Decks 9

00:19:15.985 --> 00:19:18.818
through 13 and posted security
details at every access point.

00:19:18.855 --> 00:19:21.756
I suggest we increase security
around Sick Bay as well.

00:19:21.791 --> 00:19:22.780
Already done.

00:19:22.826 --> 00:19:24.623
How far did you get
on the weapon?

00:19:24.661 --> 00:19:26.185
We are ready
to construct a prototype.

00:19:26.229 --> 00:19:28.220
You're fit to return
back to duty, Lieutenant.

00:19:29.833 --> 00:19:31.733
And you, Kes?

00:19:31.768 --> 00:19:32.735
Oh, I'm all right.

00:19:32.769 --> 00:19:34.634
The visions
have stopped for now.

00:19:40.276 --> 00:19:43.245
The plasma burns to her
thoracic region I can treat

00:19:43.279 --> 00:19:45.406
and I've already stopped
the internal bleeding,

00:19:45.448 --> 00:19:47.939
but her neural injuries
are going to require some...

00:19:47.984 --> 00:19:49.349
creative thinking.

00:19:49.385 --> 00:19:50.875
Before we beamed out,

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:53.855
an alien energy discharge
struck very near the Captain.

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:55.323
Well, it appears to have
disrupted

00:19:55.358 --> 00:19:57.383
all her neuroelectrical
pathways.

00:19:57.427 --> 00:19:58.655
I'll have to induce a coma

00:19:58.695 --> 00:20:00.526
to protect
her higher brain functions,

00:20:00.563 --> 00:20:04.055
but I must tell you, unless
I can repair the damage...

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:06.591
she may never
regain consciousness.

00:20:08.271 --> 00:20:09.795
Make sure those Borg stay put.

00:20:09.839 --> 00:20:11.636
I want tactical updates
every 20 minutes.

00:20:11.674 --> 00:20:12.800
Aye, sir.

00:20:12.842 --> 00:20:14.309
Shall I resume working
with them?

00:20:14.344 --> 00:20:15.868
Stand by for now.

00:20:15.912 --> 00:20:18.312
The Captain wishes
to speak with you.

00:20:18.348 --> 00:20:19.815
Please keep it brief.

00:20:28.691 --> 00:20:31.285
The Doctor...

00:20:31.327 --> 00:20:34.524
explained my condition.

00:20:34.564 --> 00:20:37.192
You are in command.

00:20:37.233 --> 00:20:39.030
I understand.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.238
They'll push you...

00:20:42.272 --> 00:20:44.502
they'll threaten you,

00:20:44.541 --> 00:20:47.567
but they need you.

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:50.238
They need this alliance.

00:20:53.983 --> 00:20:57.419
You have to make this work.

00:20:57.453 --> 00:21:03.688
I want you to make this work.

00:21:03.726 --> 00:21:07.822
Get this crew home.

00:21:10.366 --> 00:21:11.560
I must begin.

00:21:58.514 --> 00:22:00.482
Where is your Captain?

00:22:00.516 --> 00:22:01.813
I must speak with her.

00:22:01.851 --> 00:22:03.819
In our medical bay,
recovering.

00:22:03.853 --> 00:22:06.617
You'll be dealing with me now.

00:22:06.656 --> 00:22:09.284
Circumstances have changed.

00:22:09.325 --> 00:22:10.519
I'd say so.

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:14.087
The loss of our vessel requires
that we modify our agreement.

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:16.758
I've been giving that
some thought.

00:22:16.799 --> 00:22:19.791
I'm willing
to let you stay on board.

00:22:19.836 --> 00:22:22.168
We'll continue to work
with you on the weapon.

00:22:22.205 --> 00:22:24.799
Once we're safely out
of Borg territory,

00:22:24.841 --> 00:22:28.834
we'll give you the nanoprobes,
shake hands and part company.

00:22:30.046 --> 00:22:32.071
Insufficient.

00:22:32.115 --> 00:22:34.174
Our latest tactical
projections indicate

00:22:34.217 --> 00:22:36.276
that the war
will be lost by then.

00:22:38.488 --> 00:22:41.616
The nearest Borg vessel
is 40 light-years away.

00:22:41.658 --> 00:22:44.991
You will reverse course
and take us to it.

00:22:45.061 --> 00:22:47.757
Even at maximum warp,
that's a five-day journey...

00:22:47.797 --> 00:22:49.196
in the wrong direction.

00:22:49.232 --> 00:22:51.496
We're supposed to be
heading out of Borg space

00:22:51.534 --> 00:22:52.933
not deeper into it.

00:22:52.969 --> 00:22:54.459
There is no alternative.

00:22:54.504 --> 00:22:55.471
Look...

00:22:55.505 --> 00:22:57.666
I'll honor
the original agreement,

00:22:57.707 --> 00:22:59.265
but I'm not turning
this ship around.

00:22:59.308 --> 00:23:00.832
It's too dangerous.

00:23:03.146 --> 00:23:07.310
Denying our request
is also dangerous.

00:23:08.818 --> 00:23:10.547
I'll think about it.

00:23:10.586 --> 00:23:12.110
Think quickly.

00:23:18.327 --> 00:23:21.626
A five-day trip back into
the heart of Borg territory...

00:23:21.664 --> 00:23:23.962
it's too risky.

00:23:24.033 --> 00:23:26.263
With those drones
and the nanoprobes on board,

00:23:26.302 --> 00:23:29.100
we might as well have a
bull's-eye painted on our hull.

00:23:29.138 --> 00:23:32.630
We're a prime target
for Species 8472.

00:23:32.675 --> 00:23:34.438
We'd never survive
another attack.

00:23:34.476 --> 00:23:36.637
What is the alternative?

00:23:36.679 --> 00:23:39.705
I'm going to end this alliance,
here and now.

00:23:39.748 --> 00:23:42.911
We're going to drop the Borg off
on the next uninhabited planet,

00:23:42.952 --> 00:23:45.682
give them the nanoprobes
and take our chances alone.

00:23:45.721 --> 00:23:47.552
They can wait for a Borg ship
to pick them up

00:23:47.590 --> 00:23:48.852
and finish the weapon.

00:23:48.891 --> 00:23:50.256
I'm in command now and I

00:23:50.292 --> 00:23:52.658
have to do what I think
is best for this crew.

00:23:52.695 --> 00:23:53.787
Tom, I want you to scan

00:23:53.829 --> 00:23:56.320
for the nearest uninhabited
planet and set a course.

00:23:56.365 --> 00:23:57.332
Aye, sir.

00:23:57.366 --> 00:23:59.493
I must caution you, Commander.

00:23:59.535 --> 00:24:01.560
The Borg may not go quietly.

00:24:01.604 --> 00:24:02.935
We'll see.

00:24:02.972 --> 00:24:05.566
Bring that female drone
to the ready room.

00:24:05.608 --> 00:24:06.768
Dismissed.

00:24:09.912 --> 00:24:12.107
Once we've beamed
you to the surface,

00:24:12.147 --> 00:24:14.377
we'll send down the nanoprobes
and all our research.

00:24:14.416 --> 00:24:15.747
Unacceptable.

00:24:15.784 --> 00:24:16.944
We don't have time...

00:24:17.019 --> 00:24:18.509
This isn't open for discussion.

00:24:18.554 --> 00:24:20.385
I'm not turning
this ship around.

00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:23.521
You're getting what you wanted.

00:24:23.559 --> 00:24:25.754
I suggest we part ways amicably.

00:24:27.129 --> 00:24:29.324
There is another option.

00:24:29.365 --> 00:24:30.696
We could assimilate
your vessel.

00:24:30.733 --> 00:24:31.700
If a single drone

00:24:31.734 --> 00:24:33.929
steps one millimeter
out of that cargo bay,

00:24:33.969 --> 00:24:36.836
I'll decompress the entire deck.

00:24:36.872 --> 00:24:39.534
You won't pose much of a threat
floating in space.

00:24:42.311 --> 00:24:43.972
When your Captain
first approached us,

00:24:44.013 --> 00:24:46.481
we suspected that an agreement
with humans would prove

00:24:46.515 --> 00:24:48.745
impossible to maintain.

00:24:48.784 --> 00:24:53.949
You are erratic, conflicted,
disorganized.

00:24:53.989 --> 00:24:57.652
Every decision is debated,
every action questioned,

00:24:57.693 --> 00:25:03.154
every individual entitled
to their own small opinion.

00:25:03.198 --> 00:25:06.656
You lack harmony, cohesion...

00:25:06.702 --> 00:25:08.602
greatness.

00:25:11.240 --> 00:25:13.640
It will be your undoing.

00:25:15.577 --> 00:25:18.705
Escort our guest back
to the cargo bay.

00:25:48.644 --> 00:25:51.135
Well, I've made my decision.

00:25:51.180 --> 00:25:52.613
If it were only a matter

00:25:52.648 --> 00:25:55.879
of going against the orders
of my superior officer...

00:25:57.986 --> 00:26:01.422
You're more
than just my Captain.

00:26:01.457 --> 00:26:03.618
You're my friend.

00:26:05.694 --> 00:26:08.026
I hope you'll understand.

00:26:29.485 --> 00:26:36.186
Species 8472 has penetrated
matrix 010, grid 19.

00:26:36.225 --> 00:26:39.285
Eight planets destroyed.

00:26:39.328 --> 00:26:41.956
312 vessels disabled.

00:26:41.997 --> 00:26:46.525
4,000,621 Borg eliminated.

00:26:46.568 --> 00:26:49.503
We must seize control
of the Alpha Quadrant vessel

00:26:49.538 --> 00:26:51.665
and take it
into the alien realm.

00:26:51.707 --> 00:26:53.538
We understand.

00:27:06.455 --> 00:27:09.481
Class-H moon,
oxygen-argon atmosphere.

00:27:09.525 --> 00:27:10.617
It'll do.

00:27:10.659 --> 00:27:11.887
Take us out of warp,
and enter orbit.

00:27:11.927 --> 00:27:12.916
Aye, sir.

00:27:12.995 --> 00:27:15.122
Tuvok... stand by
to transport the Borg

00:27:15.164 --> 00:27:16.756
directly from the cargo bay.

00:27:16.799 --> 00:27:18.892
After they're on the surface,
have security run a sweep of...

00:27:18.934 --> 00:27:21.732
I'm reading power fluctuations
in the deflector array.

00:27:21.770 --> 00:27:23.067
Cause?

00:27:23.105 --> 00:27:24.936
It looks like the Borg have
accessed deflector control.

00:27:25.007 --> 00:27:26.338
They're trying to realign
the emitters.

00:27:26.375 --> 00:27:27.603
Shut them out.

00:27:31.180 --> 00:27:33.341
They've bypassed
security protocols.

00:27:41.290 --> 00:27:43.383
They're emitting
a resonant graviton beam.

00:27:43.425 --> 00:27:45.916
It's creating
another singularity!

00:27:45.961 --> 00:27:46.950
Reverse course.

00:27:47.062 --> 00:27:51.089
We're fighting intense
gravimetric distortion.

00:27:51.133 --> 00:27:52.896
I can't break free!

00:27:52.935 --> 00:27:55.460
Bridge to Cargo Bay 2.

00:27:55.504 --> 00:27:56.732
Stop what you're doing,

00:27:56.772 --> 00:27:59.502
or I'll depressurize that deck
and blow you out into space.

00:27:59.541 --> 00:28:01.475
This is your final warning.

00:28:04.213 --> 00:28:05.202
Do it.

00:28:28.170 --> 00:28:30.070
Decompression cycle complete.

00:28:33.275 --> 00:28:35.402
I still don't have
deflector control.

00:28:35.444 --> 00:28:38.038
Commander,
a single Borg has survived.

00:28:44.086 --> 00:28:46.054
We're being pulled in!

00:28:58.433 --> 00:28:59.695
Report.

00:28:59.735 --> 00:29:02.932
We appear to have crossed
an interdimensional rift.

00:29:03.972 --> 00:29:05.701
We've definitely
left our galaxy.

00:29:05.741 --> 00:29:07.834
No stars, no planets.

00:29:07.876 --> 00:29:09.275
Let's see.

00:29:12.614 --> 00:29:14.241
I'm recalibrating sensors.

00:29:16.852 --> 00:29:19.912
The entire region
is filled with...

00:29:19.988 --> 00:29:22.218
with some kind of organic fluid.

00:29:23.292 --> 00:29:25.157
This isn't space.

00:29:25.193 --> 00:29:27.127
It's matter.

00:29:28.764 --> 00:29:30.254
Commander Chakotay.

00:29:30.299 --> 00:29:33.928
We have entered the domain
of Species 8472.

00:29:34.036 --> 00:29:36.800
Report to the cargo bay.

00:29:36.838 --> 00:29:40.797
Paris, repressurize Cargo Bay 2.

00:29:40.842 --> 00:29:42.173
Tuvok.

00:29:49.451 --> 00:29:53.410
Our entry into fluidic space
has created a compression wave.

00:29:53.455 --> 00:29:55.286
They know we're here.

00:29:55.324 --> 00:29:58.953
A fleet of bioships is already
converging on our position.

00:29:58.994 --> 00:30:02.122
Time to intercept:
Three hours, 17 minutes.

00:30:02.164 --> 00:30:05.565
You've been here before.

00:30:05.601 --> 00:30:07.330
How else could you know
about fluidic space?

00:30:07.369 --> 00:30:09.837
We must prepare this vessel
for the altercation.

00:30:09.871 --> 00:30:11.736
We will construct a complement
of biomolecular war...

00:30:11.773 --> 00:30:15.402
Why?
Why were you here?

00:30:18.780 --> 00:30:22.773
You started this war...
didn't you?

00:30:24.119 --> 00:30:25.086
What's the matter?

00:30:25.120 --> 00:30:27.145
Our galaxy wasn't
big enough for you?

00:30:27.189 --> 00:30:29.157
You had to conquer
new territory?

00:30:29.191 --> 00:30:31.716
But this race fought back...

00:30:31.760 --> 00:30:34.251
a species as malevolent
as your own.

00:30:36.365 --> 00:30:41.632
Species 8472 was more resistant
than we anticipated.

00:30:41.670 --> 00:30:44.332
Their technology
is biogenically engineered.

00:30:44.373 --> 00:30:46.864
It is superior to that
of all other species

00:30:46.908 --> 00:30:48.239
we have previously encountered.

00:30:48.276 --> 00:30:50.972
Which is precisely
what you wanted.

00:30:51.013 --> 00:30:53.846
They are the apex
of biological evolution.

00:30:53.882 --> 00:30:56.476
Their assimilation
would have greatly added

00:30:56.518 --> 00:30:57.883
to our own perfection.

00:30:57.919 --> 00:31:00.114
So, instead of assimilating
these aliens,

00:31:00.155 --> 00:31:02.885
you opened a door for them
to our galaxy.

00:31:04.893 --> 00:31:07.555
There is only one
course of action.

00:31:07.596 --> 00:31:09.826
Destroy them first.

00:31:09.865 --> 00:31:11.856
My subspace link
to the collective

00:31:11.900 --> 00:31:14.733
has been weakened
by the interdimensional rift.

00:31:14.770 --> 00:31:16.795
We cannot signal for help.

00:31:16.838 --> 00:31:18.135
We are alone.

00:31:18.173 --> 00:31:22.371
We must construct a complement
of biomolecular warheads

00:31:22.411 --> 00:31:24.072
and modify your weapons
to launch them.

00:31:24.112 --> 00:31:25.875
I've got a better idea.

00:31:25.914 --> 00:31:28.314
Why don't you open up
that rift again

00:31:28.350 --> 00:31:29.977
and take us back?

00:31:30.085 --> 00:31:33.612
If I do that, you will
no longer cooperate.

00:31:33.655 --> 00:31:34.986
Doctor to Chakotay.

00:31:35.090 --> 00:31:36.148
Go ahead.

00:31:36.191 --> 00:31:37.988
Report to Sick Bay at once.

00:31:38.026 --> 00:31:39.755
On my way.

00:31:45.999 --> 00:31:46.988
Captain?

00:31:47.101 --> 00:31:49.934
Ah, as you can see,

00:31:49.970 --> 00:31:52.200
I've repaired her neural damage.

00:31:52.239 --> 00:31:55.675
Ensign Kim, the Captain...
I'm two for two.

00:31:55.709 --> 00:31:57.643
Doctor, if you'll excuse us
for a moment.

00:31:57.678 --> 00:31:59.111
Hmm?

00:31:59.146 --> 00:32:00.773
Eh?

00:32:00.814 --> 00:32:04.215
Oh. Gladly.

00:32:04.251 --> 00:32:06.014
Computer,
deactivate EMH program.

00:32:09.123 --> 00:32:10.954
The Doctor brought
me up to speed,

00:32:11.058 --> 00:32:15.256
but he couldn't tell me
what I really wanted to know.

00:32:15.295 --> 00:32:17.889
Why?

00:32:17.931 --> 00:32:20.399
The collective ordered me
to reverse course,

00:32:20.434 --> 00:32:22.959
travel 40 light-years
back the way we came.

00:32:23.036 --> 00:32:23.968
What would you have done?

00:32:24.037 --> 00:32:25.504
I probably would have
reversed course...

00:32:25.539 --> 00:32:27.234
maintained the alliance
as long as possible.

00:32:27.274 --> 00:32:29.367
In my mind, the alliance
was already over.

00:32:29.409 --> 00:32:30.376
You never trusted me.

00:32:30.410 --> 00:32:31.968
You never believed
this would work.

00:32:32.012 --> 00:32:33.809
You were just waiting
for an opportunity

00:32:33.847 --> 00:32:34.973
to circumvent my orders.

00:32:35.015 --> 00:32:36.676
Trust had nothing to do with it.

00:32:36.717 --> 00:32:38.116
I made a tactical decision.

00:32:38.152 --> 00:32:39.414
And so did I.

00:32:39.453 --> 00:32:41.614
They've been taking advantage
of us from day one.

00:32:41.655 --> 00:32:43.486
We made concessions,
so did they.

00:32:43.524 --> 00:32:44.684
They lied.

00:32:44.725 --> 00:32:48.126
The Borg started the war
with Species 8472.

00:32:51.865 --> 00:32:54.527
We've only got one Borg left
to worry about.

00:32:54.568 --> 00:32:55.694
We should try to disable her

00:32:55.736 --> 00:32:57.226
and get back
to the Delta Quadrant.

00:32:57.271 --> 00:32:59.933
We might be able to duplicate
the deflector protocols

00:32:59.973 --> 00:33:01.634
they used to open a singularity.

00:33:01.675 --> 00:33:04.109
No.

00:33:04.144 --> 00:33:07.113
I won't be caught tinkering
with the deflector

00:33:07.147 --> 00:33:08.808
when those aliens attack.

00:33:08.849 --> 00:33:11.044
There is no other way out
of this, Chakotay.

00:33:11.084 --> 00:33:12.483
It's too late for opinions.

00:33:12.519 --> 00:33:13.850
It's too late for discussion.

00:33:13.887 --> 00:33:15.946
It's time to make the call,
and I'm making it.

00:33:16.023 --> 00:33:19.459
We fight the aliens, in full
cooperation with the Borg.

00:33:19.493 --> 00:33:22.189
I was linked
to a collective once, remember?

00:33:22.229 --> 00:33:24.789
I had a neuro-transceiver
embedded in my spine.

00:33:24.832 --> 00:33:26.493
I know who we're dealing with.

00:33:26.533 --> 00:33:28.626
We've got to get rid
of that last Borg

00:33:28.669 --> 00:33:30.193
and take our chances alone.

00:33:30.237 --> 00:33:33.001
It won't work.

00:33:34.308 --> 00:33:36.173
This isn't working, either.

00:33:36.210 --> 00:33:37.404
There are two wars going on...

00:33:37.444 --> 00:33:38.672
the one out there

00:33:38.712 --> 00:33:42.148
and the one in here, and...
we're losing both of them.

00:33:44.051 --> 00:33:45.712
"It will be your undoing."

00:33:45.752 --> 00:33:47.014
What?

00:33:49.356 --> 00:33:53.690
Our conflicted nature,
our individuality.

00:33:53.727 --> 00:33:55.786
Seven of Nine said
that we lacked

00:33:55.829 --> 00:33:57.820
the cohesion
of a collective mind.

00:33:57.865 --> 00:33:59.730
That one day,
it would divide us

00:33:59.766 --> 00:34:01.495
and destroy us.

00:34:01.535 --> 00:34:04.561
And here we are,
proving her point.

00:34:04.605 --> 00:34:07.733
I'll tell you when we lost
control of this situation,

00:34:07.774 --> 00:34:10.504
when we made our mistake.

00:34:10.544 --> 00:34:13.274
It was the moment
we turned away from each other.

00:34:13.313 --> 00:34:15.713
We don't have to stop being
individuals to get through this.

00:34:15.749 --> 00:34:18.877
We just have to stop
fighting each other.

00:34:31.131 --> 00:34:32.496
Captain Janeway.

00:34:32.532 --> 00:34:35.228
I've relieved Mr. Chakotay
of his duties

00:34:35.269 --> 00:34:36.668
and confined him to the brig.

00:34:36.703 --> 00:34:38.500
I'm back in command.

00:34:41.008 --> 00:34:43.875
And you understand
the situation?

00:34:43.911 --> 00:34:45.208
Completely.

00:34:45.245 --> 00:34:47.611
Tuvok, give her the nanoprobes.

00:34:47.648 --> 00:34:48.637
Work with her.

00:34:48.682 --> 00:34:50.843
Build as many warheads
as you can

00:34:50.884 --> 00:34:52.943
and start modifying
our weapon systems.

00:34:52.986 --> 00:34:56.478
I suggest we think about
enhancing our defenses as well.

00:34:56.523 --> 00:34:57.956
If we're going
to fight this battle,

00:34:57.991 --> 00:34:59.652
I intend to win it.

00:34:59.693 --> 00:35:01.092
We are in agreement.

00:35:01.128 --> 00:35:02.254
Good.

00:35:03.563 --> 00:35:05.394
This is the plan.

00:35:05.432 --> 00:35:08.697
We engage the enemy here,
in their space.

00:35:08.735 --> 00:35:10.464
We show them
what they're up against.

00:35:10.504 --> 00:35:12.267
If they have any sense
of self-preservation,

00:35:12.306 --> 00:35:13.500
they'll back off,

00:35:13.540 --> 00:35:15.838
pull their ships
out of the Delta Quadrant.

00:35:15.876 --> 00:35:17.571
That's provided
the weapons are effective.

00:35:17.611 --> 00:35:18.737
If they aren't...

00:35:18.779 --> 00:35:21.304
it's been nice working with you.

00:35:23.817 --> 00:35:25.284
We've got to get this ship
armed and ready

00:35:25.319 --> 00:35:27.583
in under two hours.

00:35:28.889 --> 00:35:30.447
We're going to war.

00:35:52.713 --> 00:35:54.305
Borg modifications are complete.

00:35:54.348 --> 00:35:56.373
Bring them on line.

00:36:01.421 --> 00:36:03.548
Torpedo launch tubes active.

00:36:03.590 --> 00:36:05.057
Hull armor engaged.

00:36:05.092 --> 00:36:06.559
Shield enhancements stable.

00:36:06.593 --> 00:36:08.458
Biomolecular weapons are ready.

00:36:08.495 --> 00:36:12.795
13 standard photon torpedoes
and one class-10 armed

00:36:12.833 --> 00:36:14.596
with a high-yield warhead.

00:36:14.634 --> 00:36:17.068
All hands, this is the Captain.

00:36:17.104 --> 00:36:18.435
Ready your stations,

00:36:18.472 --> 00:36:21.066
seal all emergency
bulkheads, and prepare

00:36:21.108 --> 00:36:22.097
to engage the enemy.

00:36:22.142 --> 00:36:23.666
Stand by for my orders.

00:36:29.783 --> 00:36:32.752
Four bioships
have just entered sensor range.

00:36:32.786 --> 00:36:33.946
Battle stations.

00:36:35.122 --> 00:36:37.454
I've got a visual.

00:36:37.491 --> 00:36:39.288
On screen.

00:36:49.336 --> 00:36:50.303
I can hear them.

00:36:50.337 --> 00:36:51.929
They want to talk through me.

00:36:53.206 --> 00:36:56.539
They say we've contaminated
their realm.

00:36:56.576 --> 00:36:57.975
Tell them we had no choice.

00:36:58.045 --> 00:37:00.172
We were only trying
to defend ourselves.

00:37:05.018 --> 00:37:07.509
They say our galaxy is impure.

00:37:07.554 --> 00:37:12.890
Its proximity is a threat
to their... genetic integrity.

00:37:12.926 --> 00:37:15.656
Tell them we have a weapon,
a devastating weapon

00:37:15.695 --> 00:37:17.595
that can destroy them
at the cellular level.

00:37:17.631 --> 00:37:20.065
If they don't stop their attacks
on the Delta Quadrant,

00:37:20.100 --> 00:37:21.294
we'll be forced to use it.

00:37:24.638 --> 00:37:28.130
They said, "Your galaxy
will be purged."

00:37:44.558 --> 00:37:46.549
Shields and weapons
are off-line!

00:37:46.593 --> 00:37:48.527
Rerouting emergency power
to the launchers.

00:37:48.562 --> 00:37:50.257
They're coming around
for another assault!

00:37:50.297 --> 00:37:51.389
I've lost thrusters!

00:37:51.431 --> 00:37:53.865
Biomolecular warheads
are charged and ready.

00:37:53.900 --> 00:37:55.492
Fire.

00:38:03.543 --> 00:38:06.239
Direct hit on all four vessels.

00:38:06.279 --> 00:38:07.507
No effect.

00:38:08.448 --> 00:38:09.847
They're charging weapons.

00:38:23.797 --> 00:38:26.925
The nanoprobes were successful,
if not prompt.

00:38:26.967 --> 00:38:29.299
All four ships
have been destroyed.

00:38:29.336 --> 00:38:32.134
I think we've made our point.

00:38:32.172 --> 00:38:34.367
Now open a singularity
and get us out of here.

00:38:50.257 --> 00:38:51.554
Captain.

00:38:55.795 --> 00:38:56.955
Kes, are you still in contact?

00:38:56.997 --> 00:38:58.931
Yes.

00:38:58.965 --> 00:39:00.557
Tell them if they continue
their attack,

00:39:00.600 --> 00:39:01.760
we'll use the weapon again.

00:39:05.105 --> 00:39:06.299
They're not responding.

00:39:06.339 --> 00:39:07.567
Evasive maneuvers.

00:39:07.607 --> 00:39:08.665
Aye, Captain.

00:39:10.143 --> 00:39:11.075
They're in pursuit.

00:39:11.111 --> 00:39:12.908
Prepare to fire
the high-yield warhead.

00:39:12.946 --> 00:39:14.413
Aft torpedo bay.

00:39:21.988 --> 00:39:23.080
Ready, Captain.

00:39:23.123 --> 00:39:24.112
Do it.

00:39:34.467 --> 00:39:36.799
13 bioships have been destroyed.

00:39:36.836 --> 00:39:38.929
The others are in retreat.

00:39:38.972 --> 00:39:42.339
I have regained full contact
with the collective.

00:39:44.644 --> 00:39:46.043
What are they saying?

00:39:48.915 --> 00:39:51.782
All remaining bioships
in the Delta Quadrant

00:39:51.818 --> 00:39:53.843
are returning to their realm.

00:39:54.854 --> 00:39:56.822
The Borg have prevailed.

00:39:56.856 --> 00:40:00.359
With a little help from us.

00:40:00.492 --> 00:40:03.154
Now, it's time you fulfilled
your end of the agreement.

00:40:03.195 --> 00:40:06.722
Tell the collective we expect
safe passage from here on out.

00:40:06.765 --> 00:40:08.164
We'll give you a shuttlecraft.

00:40:08.200 --> 00:40:10.498
You can head
for the nearest Borg ship.

00:40:11.536 --> 00:40:13.197
Unacceptable.

00:40:13.238 --> 00:40:15.365
This alliance is terminated.

00:40:15.407 --> 00:40:19.241
Your ship and its crew
will adapt to service us.

00:40:23.582 --> 00:40:25.812
Resistance is futile.

00:40:29.254 --> 00:40:30.744
Captain, she's tapping
into helm control.

00:40:30.789 --> 00:40:32.723
She's trying to access
our coordinates.

00:40:32.758 --> 00:40:34.885
Shut her out.

00:40:34.926 --> 00:40:35.915
I can't.

00:40:35.961 --> 00:40:36.985
Bridge to Chakotay.

00:40:37.028 --> 00:40:38.256
Scorpion.

00:40:44.569 --> 00:40:47.561
Seven of Nine,
stop what you're doing.

00:40:47.606 --> 00:40:51.337
You're human,
a human individual.

00:40:51.376 --> 00:40:53.970
Our minds are linked.
We are one.

00:40:54.012 --> 00:40:55.775
I can hear your thoughts.

00:40:55.814 --> 00:40:58.248
His link is stable,
but it won't be for long.

00:40:58.283 --> 00:40:59.409
You must hurry.

00:40:59.451 --> 00:41:02.750
Just a few more seconds.

00:41:02.788 --> 00:41:04.756
I can see your memories.

00:41:06.958 --> 00:41:08.391
You remember being human.

00:41:08.427 --> 00:41:10.793
We are Borg.

00:41:10.829 --> 00:41:13.559
I see a young girl.

00:41:14.699 --> 00:41:16.929
A family.

00:41:19.538 --> 00:41:20.630
Irrelevant.

00:41:20.672 --> 00:41:23.106
Your appeal to my humanity
is pointless.

00:41:23.141 --> 00:41:24.904
Almost there, Chakotay.

00:41:24.943 --> 00:41:26.069
You've got
to keep her distracted

00:41:26.111 --> 00:41:27.271
if we're going
to make this work.

00:41:27.312 --> 00:41:29.780
Listen to your human side...

00:41:29.815 --> 00:41:31.407
to yourself...

00:41:31.450 --> 00:41:32.417
the little girl.

00:41:33.819 --> 00:41:36.583
Seven of Nine... Annika.

00:41:36.621 --> 00:41:38.384
He's losing the link!

00:41:38.423 --> 00:41:40.152
Initiating power surge...

00:41:40.192 --> 00:41:41.989
now!

00:42:00.846 --> 00:42:03.406
Her connection
to the collective is severed.

00:42:03.448 --> 00:42:04.972
Get her to Sick Bay.

00:42:06.518 --> 00:42:07.576
Bridge to Doctor.

00:42:07.619 --> 00:42:08.745
Report.

00:42:11.122 --> 00:42:13.716
Commander Chakotay's going
to be all right,

00:42:13.758 --> 00:42:16.124
although he may wake up
with a bit of a headache.

00:42:16.161 --> 00:42:18.823
Tom, plot a course
out of Borg space...

00:42:18.864 --> 00:42:20.388
maximum warp.

00:42:20.432 --> 00:42:22.024
Yes, ma'am.

00:42:23.735 --> 00:42:28.536
Captain's Log, Stardate 51003.7.

00:42:28.573 --> 00:42:32.100
Three days, and no sign
of Borg or bioships.

00:42:32.143 --> 00:42:33.872
We appear to be out of danger,

00:42:33.912 --> 00:42:36.244
but the entire crew is on edge

00:42:36.281 --> 00:42:37.748
and so am I.

00:42:37.782 --> 00:42:40.751
Not even the calm
of Master da Vinci's workshop

00:42:40.785 --> 00:42:42.514
is enough to ease my mind.

00:42:56.268 --> 00:42:57.462
Am I interrupting?

00:42:57.502 --> 00:42:58.662
Not at all.

00:42:58.703 --> 00:43:00.694
I'm just finishing up my log.

00:43:00.739 --> 00:43:02.206
The old-fashioned way.

00:43:02.240 --> 00:43:03.935
I wanted to get as far away

00:43:03.975 --> 00:43:06.603
from bio-implants
and fluidic space and...

00:43:06.645 --> 00:43:10.342
and this feels
more human somehow.

00:43:10.382 --> 00:43:11.940
I hate to spoil the mood,

00:43:12.050 --> 00:43:13.244
but you might want
to take a look

00:43:13.285 --> 00:43:14.309
at this Engineering report.

00:43:14.352 --> 00:43:15.478
It'll take at least two weeks

00:43:15.520 --> 00:43:18.353
to remove the Borg technology
from our systems.

00:43:18.390 --> 00:43:19.823
B'Elanna did note

00:43:19.858 --> 00:43:22.827
that the power couplings
on Deck 8 work better

00:43:22.861 --> 00:43:24.385
with the Borg improvements.

00:43:24.429 --> 00:43:26.192
Leave them.

00:43:26.231 --> 00:43:27.391
How is our passenger?

00:43:27.432 --> 00:43:29.161
The Doctor says
she's stabilizing.

00:43:29.200 --> 00:43:31.691
Her human cells
are starting to regenerate.

00:43:31.736 --> 00:43:35.172
I wonder what's left under
all that Borg technology...

00:43:35.206 --> 00:43:37.606
if she can ever
become human again.

00:43:37.642 --> 00:43:39.269
You plan to keep her on board?

00:43:39.311 --> 00:43:40.972
We pulled the plug.

00:43:41.079 --> 00:43:43.570
We're responsible
for what happens to her now.

00:43:45.750 --> 00:43:48.412
She was assimilated
at a very young age.

00:43:48.453 --> 00:43:50.978
The collective's all she knows.

00:43:51.089 --> 00:43:53.785
She might not want to stay.

00:43:53.825 --> 00:43:55.690
I think she might.

00:43:55.727 --> 00:43:59.060
We have something
the Borg could never offer.

00:44:01.132 --> 00:44:03.066
Friendship.

00:44:05.136 --> 00:44:07.229
I want you to know
that disobeying your orders

00:44:07.272 --> 00:44:09.934
was one of the most difficult
things I've ever had to do.

00:44:09.975 --> 00:44:12.205
I understand.

00:44:12.243 --> 00:44:15.076
And I respect
the decision you made,

00:44:15.113 --> 00:44:17.172
even though I disagree with it.

00:44:17.215 --> 00:44:19.683
What's important
is that, in the end,

00:44:19.718 --> 00:44:21.811
we got through this, together.

00:44:21.853 --> 00:44:24.321
I don't ever want that
to change.

00:44:24.356 --> 00:44:26.256
Agreed.

00:44:26.291 --> 00:44:28.384
Good.

00:44:28.426 --> 00:44:29.450
Well...

00:44:29.494 --> 00:44:32.122
I think it's time
we get back to our Bridge.

00:44:32.163 --> 00:44:33.528
No argument there.
